{"lines": ["How is King Von connected to Mao Zedong?", "In twenty eighteen, Lil Durk signed King Von to his label, Only the Family, and the two Chicago rappers became inseparable.", "Durk idolizes Kanye West, even naming a twenty twenty-one song after him, and the two have hung out.", "In December twenty sixteen, Kanye visited the newly elected Donald Trump at Trump Tower in New York.", "Months later, President Trump hosted Henry Kissinger, the diplomat who opened America's door to China.", "And in nineteen seventy-five in Beijing, Kissinger shook hands with Chairman Mao Zedong himself.", "How is Attila the Hun connected to Squidward?", "Around fifteen fourteen, Raphael painted Pope Leo I meeting Attila the Hun, who spared Rome in 452.", "From Leo, the 45th pope, the line runs unbroken to the 266th, Pope Francis.", "In twenty fifteen, Vice President Joe Biden greeted Pope Francis at the White House.", "In twenty twenty-four, President Biden welcomed Star Wars legend Mark Hamill to the Oval Office.", "In twenty twenty-five, Hamill, the Flying Dutchman in the new SpongeBob movie, posed with the cast, including Rodger Bumpass.", "And Rodger Bumpass has been the voice of Squidward since nineteen ninety-nine.", "How is Queen Victoria connected to Big Bird?", "In eighteen ninety-five at Balmoral, Queen Victoria posed with her baby great-grandson, the future King Edward the Eighth.", "In nineteen seventy, Edward, who gave up the throne to become Duke of Windsor, dined at Richard Nixon's White House.", "From nineteen sixty-nine to nineteen seventy-four, Pat Nixon served beside him as first lady.", "And in December nineteen seventy, Big Bird visited Pat Nixon at the White House with a Christmas gift feather.", "How is Leonardo da Vinci connected to Luigi?", "In eighteen eighteen, a French artist painted Leonardo dying in the arms of his patron, King Francis the First.", "The French throne passed from Francis through Louis the Fourteenth, Napoleon and de Gaulle to Emmanuel Macron.", "In twenty twenty-three, Macron joined King Charles the Third in Paris to plant a tree at the British embassy.", "In twenty twenty-two, the King toured Wrexham's football ground with its co-owner, actor Rob McElhenney.", "McElhenney created It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia, starring his old friend Charlie Day.", "And in twenty twenty-three, Charlie Day became the voice of Luigi in the Super Mario Bros Movie.", "How is Elvis Presley connected to Barack Obama?", "In December nineteen seventy, Elvis showed up at the White House and asked Richard Nixon to make him a federal drug agent.", "In nineteen seventy-three, Nixon picked Gerald Ford as his vice president. Less than a year later, Ford had Nixon's job.", "In nineteen ninety-seven, Ford shared a stage with President Bill Clinton at the opening of a presidential library in Texas.", "And in twenty thirteen, Barack Obama hung the Presidential Medal of Freedom around Clinton's neck."], "heard": [["How", 0.0, 0.34], ["is", 0.34, 0.52], ["King", 0.52, 0.7], ["Von", 0.7, 1.02], ["connected", 1.02, 1.5], ["to", 1.5, 1.78], ["Mao", 1.78, 2.06], ["Zedong?", 2.06, 2.52], ["In", 3.44, 3.5], ["2018,", 3.5, 3.92], ["Lil", 3.92, 4.36], ["Durk", 4.36, 4.72], ["signed", 4.72, 4.92], ["King", 4.92, 5.16], ["Von", 5.16, 5.42], ["to", 5.42, 5.62], ["his", 5.62, 5.72], ["label,", 5.72, 5.9], ["Only", 6.44, 6.46], ["the", 6.46, 6.58], ["Family,", 6.58, 6.8], ["and", 7.22, 7.38], ["the", 7.38, 7.46], ["two", 7.46, 7.6], ["Chicago", 7.6, 7.86], ["rappers", 7.86, 8.26], ["became", 8.26, 8.68], ["inseparable.", 8.68, 9.4], ["Durk", 9.92, 10.24], ["idolizes", 10.24, 10.78], ["Kanye", 10.78, 11.06], ["West,", 11.06, 11.38], ["even", 11.76, 11.84], ["naming", 11.84, 12.04], ["a", 12.04, 12.22], ["2021", 12.22, 12.42], ["song", 12.42, 13.14], ["after", 13.14, 13.38], ["him,", 13.38, 13.7], ["and", 14.0, 14.1], ["the", 14.1, 14.22], ["two", 14.22, 14.3], ["have", 14.3, 14.48], ["hung", 14.48, 14.58], ["out.", 14.58, 14.76], ["In", 15.44,